X-Wing's changes on top of the Secret Weapons of the Luftwaffe patches: XWING.EXE entry and size, no PLINK probe,
the 1993-02-01 clock, music drivers loaded by INT 21h AX=4B03 mapped as modules, events.csv.gz.
